<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-07T02:06:16.031Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 02:06:16 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistani security forces again foiled a cross-border infiltration attempt in Upper Kurram, killing the attackers and destroying their posts, while Afghan Taliban members were arrested in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa. A bus-truck collision on the Hazara Motorway killed eight people and injured thirty, and a separate crash in Punjab killed eleven and injured thirty-three, adding to recent transport fatalities. NADRA officials were targeted in Peshawar, where one officer was killed and another was shot near his office. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQd21RU1NkQTBzcWZoSHcxZGdQNnJhZ2ktb1BadFNLcDdsMUN0M0dabEFidU8tSFpUb2xYOUlsbDNHbmFxVlJwQjBRNnF3Y0ZhbC1CQVYzMTdwT0lsRExZYjdmN1JNVjJvRlVIcnRBRDhWSHE3NlBBRDYxbDBNM1FxZDF5Mk9Rdm5xMm5nS09tRFlrMW9XT0lSOUJvZjFFcXJn?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9TTjhoazE2U0lDMi1aXzlRWWRqcVJtQVhvZmdFNlR2Vk5hWTFOcEpIUzZpMC1pbnBhbjBWNXJxWkFUS3JDWUhaMQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Batting with Bimal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Business Recorder&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQcFdCZjR5b010TURQX29YbWVLRUxrNUJQclJ3dWZ4dzJMdzhfSjdmYUxKWTA4Umw5bFVpVlJ2X3ZHQm9DN0JvYjNGMjVmVFFvNUVyeGdUdlJEMGMzWTBrbGhKMWhCSXByNWFuWVVXYy1QaEg4X0lCS3BwaDlFS0Q2QU5KbmhLLW9VaUpuT1JtYnZNTWktSHMybWpsaXBrdnhGdTB0elhQS3B4SlJQTDZ1S0JR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bol News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNUG9sRnI3MURUeXQ3TUFpRlR6ZUVuZXM0S3BUSThWUGNkS0RpbkM3YVk4NnVPYzFFX0FUbkRIWjAyc0RqanhwSDkwR044YjhPbHFlOVgtQzZXRlF0UVFnNWhWVl91UmtpUGE1Mm9IWW4tOGJiNDRQc2JaU01PdURHNzI0eWNidGNaUXlnV1ppQVR